{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless British Clinic.<br>Observe your surroundings carefully to reach your appointment with Dr Ann O'Malley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for anomalies to reach your important appointment.<strong> </strong>  <br>If you find anomalies, enter the lift on the left.   <br>If you don't find anomalies, enter the lift on the right.   <br>  <br>  Anomaly Clinic is a short walking simulator inspired by British Hospitals, Exit 8, liminal spaces and back rooms.   <br>The game is only available in English, but if you understand the above description of the anomaly, you can probably play it all the way through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Spot anomalies&quot; game inspired by &quot;The Exit 8&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreating the ambiance of a British Hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of\u00a0 interesting British characters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219230?t=1762461838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219230/6a177e35a878bc235d901d2a357604092163234a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762461838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219230/cbc33ec6a554a0acc4d95c3a85fdb5b0ecae376d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762461838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219230/cbc33ec6a554a0acc4d95c3a85fdb5b0ecae376d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762461838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There are some references to the excessive use of alcohol and to